## AzaadAwaaz onion services (spec §10, §11).
##
## Two v3 onion services in front of the `web` container, reached over unix
## sockets in the shared `onion-sockets` volume (no TCP hop, no client
## addresses anywhere):
##   web : the public site            -> /run/onion/web.sock
##   mod : the moderator area         -> /run/onion/mod.sock (client authorisation)
##
## Keys: the vanity `azaad...` key made with mkp224o goes in
## /var/lib/tor/hs_web/ (hs_ed25519_secret_key, hs_ed25519_public_key,
## hostname), mode 0700, owned by the tor user. Back the keys up encrypted, in
## two places. See infra/prod/README.md.
##
## The second onion "on a separate server" (spec §10) is this same container
## deployed on the second host with its own key; add Onionbalance in front of
## both if load requires.

DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
# This container only hosts onion services: no SOCKS client, no relaying.
SocksPort 0
ClientOnly 1
ExitRelay 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*
# Log to stdout at notice level; SafeLogging scrubs addresses from Tor's logs.
Log notice stdout
SafeLogging 1
AvoidDiskWrites 1

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- public web
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/hs_web
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServicePort 80 unix:/run/onion/web.sock
# Tor's proof-of-work DoS defence (needs Tor >= 0.4.8 built with the pow module).
HiddenServicePoWDefensesEnabled 1
HiddenServicePoWQueueRate 250
HiddenServicePoWQueueBurst 2500
# Rate-limit introductions at the introduction points too.
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense 1
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSRatePerSec 25
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSBurstPerSec 200
HiddenServiceMaxStreams 200
HiddenServiceMaxStreamsCloseCircuit 1

## ----------------------------------------------------------- moderator area
## Only clients whose public keys are in /var/lib/tor/hs_mod/authorized_clients/
## (one <name>.auth file per moderator: "descriptor:x25519:<base32 pubkey>")
## can even find this service's descriptor.
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/hs_mod
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServicePort 80 unix:/run/onion/mod.sock
HiddenServicePoWDefensesEnabled 1
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense 1
HiddenServiceMaxStreams 50
HiddenServiceMaxStreamsCloseCircuit 1
